[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "むっかー！\u3000どうしてあんたはそうなんだよ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Arrgh! Why are you always like this?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あなたこそどうしてそんなにいい加減なの！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "And why are YOU always so careless?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミミ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mimi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "「これだから錬金術士は！」「これだから科学者は！」",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "\"This is why I can't stand alchemists!\" \"This is why I can't stand scientists!\""
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ/ミミ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi/Mimi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あらら、仲良くなったと思ったのに",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh dear, and I thought they were getting along..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロロナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rorona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "まだまだ道のりは遠そうですね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "They've still a long way to go, it seems."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "フロッケ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Flocke"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "プラフター！\u3000聞いてよー！\nうちの会の子がさー！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta! Listen to this! The kids in my club are—"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ソフィー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はいはい、なんですか、ソフィー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes, yes, what is it, Sophie?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "プラフタ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それに比べて、なんだかソフィーたちは仲良くなった\nみたいだね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But it looks like Sophie and Plachta have become pretty good friends."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ソフィーさんが運営してる、日影の会って言うのが\nあって、その運営の相談にプラフタが乗ったんだって",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie runs this group called the Sunshine Club, and Plachta's been helping her manage it."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クラウディア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そこからぐっと仲良くなったみたい",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "They've grown quite close since then."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クラウディア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うん！\u3000もう運営の師匠だね！\u3000師匠！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeah! She's like my club management mentor! Mentor!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ソフィー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "やめてください",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Please stop that."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "プラフタ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ハイディも打ち解けられるといいんだけどな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I hope Heidi can warm up to everyone too."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ソフィー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "気にかけてるんですね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You're concerned about her?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "プラフタ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "なんだかどこかで会ったことがあるような気がして",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I just feel like I've met her somewhere before."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ソフィー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うーん、やっぱり気のせいかなあ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hmm, maybe it's just my imagination..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ソフィー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "まあ、ハイディとミミのあれは、１つの仲良しの形かも\nしれません",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well, what's happening between Heidi and Mimi might just be their own form of friendship."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "プラフタ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "クラウディア、今回は本当にありがとうございました",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia, thank you so much for everything this time."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "プラフタ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "私は何もしてないよ。これもプラフタの実力だよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I didn't do anything. This was all your achievement, Plachta."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クラウディア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "私も大いに貢献した自負はありますが……。\nアイドル売りのプロデュースと言い、どうして――",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I certainly take pride in my contributions, but... First the idol production, and now this—why—"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "プラフタ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "しーっ。ダメだよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Shh! Don't say anything!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クラウディア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "秘密があったほうが、世の中面白いんだから",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The world's more interesting when there are secrets, you know."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クラウディア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……まったく",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Honestly."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "プラフタ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "え、え、なんの話？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Huh? What are you talking about?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ソフィー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "おや、ハイディとミミの言い争いが激化しています。\n止めに行きましょう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh my, Heidi and Mimi's argument is escalating. We should go stop them."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "プラフタ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "おおっと、これは大変だ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Whoa, this is bad!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ソフィー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ねえ。留学って、あとどのくらいいるの？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hey. How much longer do we have for our exchange program?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "どうしたの急に",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What's with the sudden question?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クラウディア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "やっぱり、グループ実習楽しかったなって思ってさ。\n終わったらちょっと寂しくなっちゃった",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I was just thinking how fun the group project was. Now that it's over, I'm feeling a little sad."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "分かるなあ。私も楽しかった",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I know what you mean. I had fun too."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クラウディア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Ryza."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クラウディア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うん？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeah?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "私、夢を追いかける。お父さんの仕事、\nやっぱり継ごうと思うんだ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I've decided that I'm going to take over my father's business after all."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クラウディア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 33,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そっか。うん、それがクラウディアらしいと思う。\n実習中のクラウディア、すっごく輝いてたから",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh yeah? That fits you, Klaudia. You were absolutely shining during the group exercise."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 34,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "別の進路に行くことになってちょっと寂しいけど、\n離れてても私たちが友達であることは変わらない",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'm a bit sad we'll be taking different paths, but even apart, we'll always be friends."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クラウディア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 35,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それに……きっとどこかで、またライザとは\n会える気がするんだ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "And... I have this feeling we'll meet again somewhere, someday."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クラウディア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 36,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うん。あたしもそう思う。\nその日を目指して……あたしも錬金術、頑張るよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeah. I feel the same way. I'll keep working hard on my alchemy until then."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 37,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "だから、いつか必ず……一緒に仕事したり、\n遊んだりしようね！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So someday, for sure... let's work on something together and have fun again!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 38,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うん……約束！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes... it's a promise!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クラウディア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 39,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……そういえば。さっき何を書いてたの？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...By the way. What were you writing earlier?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クラウディア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 40,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ん？\u3000次の時間のテストに備えてメモを",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hmm? Just some notes to prepare for the test next period."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 41,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "え！？\u3000私たちが作ったメモ？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What?! The notes we made?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クラウディア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 42,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "たくさん書いたんだ。これがあれば、テストは\n完璧間違いなし！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I wrote a ton. With these, I'm guaranteed to ace the test!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 43,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あむあむ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "*munch munch*"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 44,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そんなに一度に食べたら……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You shouldn't eat that much at once...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クラウディア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 45,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……う",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Ugh."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 46,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "お腹が痛くなってきた……。\nクラウディア……あたし、ダメかも……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "My stomach hurts... Klaudia... I don't think I'm going to make it..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 47,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ライザ！\u3000しっかりして！\u3000ライザ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza! Hang in there! Ryza!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クラウディア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 48,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ごめん。クラウディア……約束は……守れないかも……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'm sorry, Klaudia... I might not... be able to keep... our promise..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 49,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "トイレええええ！！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "BATHROOM!!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 50,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ライザー！！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "RYZAAA!!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クラウディア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]